9. POSSIBLE NEXT STEPS
--------------------------------------------------

The application should not merely say:

    GOOD

or:

    BAD

For meaningful concerns, evaluate whether it can provide safe, useful next-step guidance.

Examples of next-step categories:

    INVESTIGATE
    VERIFY
    REVIEW OWNERSHIP
    CHECK DEPENDENCIES
    MONITOR
    CONSIDER CLEANUP
    CONSIDER CAPACITY ACTION

Recommendations must be proportional to the evidence.

